{names:['monk fruit extract','monk fruit fruit extract','luo han guo extract','luo han guo fruit extract'],role:'High-intensity sweetener / fruit extract',use:'High-intensity sweetener / fruit extract',form:'An extract associated with monk fruit, also called Luo Han Guo. Mogrosides contribute its sweetness, but the ingredient name does not identify their concentration, extraction method, carrier ingredients or purity. Whole monk fruit, juice concentrate and a blended tabletop sweetener are not automatically treated as identical preparations.',purpose:'May sweeten foods or beverages. Actual concentration, amount and manufacturer intent are unknown.',difference:'FDA has not questioned certain manufacturers\' GRAS determinations for specified monk-fruit extracts under their intended conditions of use. That is not blanket FDA approval of every extract or certification of this product. The ingredient name alone does not establish zero calories, zero carbohydrate, absence of other sweeteners, or a product-specific health benefit.',source:'https://www.fda.gov/food/food-additives-petitions/aspartame-and-other-sweeteners-food',sourceLabel:'FDA: monk-fruit extracts and notice-specific GRAS status',formUnspecified:true,reviewed:'2026-10-12'}
